              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 37,
                "start": 37
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Kimberly, metrics used to predict electoral outcomes are reliable and uncontested."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Michael B. Kimberly",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d0dc013999b70159252824ed3dab9324a50dcd9d96ce76d6ec724cb3759c2288",
